# .pii-denylist — LOCAL ONLY, never committed (.gitignore excludes it).
#
# Names, employers, clients and project code names that structural patterns
# cannot detect. One term per line, case-insensitive substring match.
# Copy to `.pii-denylist` and fill in with YOUR sensitive terms.
#
# Example:
# Acme Corporation
# Jane Doe
# project-bluebird
